00:20:15,860 --> 00:20:18,757
And aeguses that could defend
against dragon's breath.

267
00:20:18,840 --> 00:20:21,487
Even the Brionac can
burn dragons to a crisp.

268
00:20:21,920 --> 00:20:24,685
How are they now all
broken down and worthless?

269
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:29,897
Please, you must tell me who you are.

270
00:20:29,980 --> 00:20:32,280
And why haven't you killed me yet?

271
00:20:33,500 --> 00:20:35,420
No, not that weapon.

272
00:20:43,020 --> 00:20:45,120
King Clay's Black Blade.

273
00:20:47,040 --> 00:20:50,200
The one dungeon relic I
covet above all others.

274
00:20:50,600 --> 00:20:52,460
Why does this man have it?

275
00:20:52,640 --> 00:20:54,380
No, don't be.

276
00:20:54,900 --> 00:20:58,117
Wait, that sword is made
from an unknown metal.

277
00:20:58,200 --> 00:21:01,788
It is supposed to be too heavy
for any normal human to carry.

278
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:06,391
I have heard even that freakishly strong
king needed both hands to wield it.

279
00:21:06,780 --> 00:21:09,700
There's no way anyone
could surpass King Klai's.

280
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:17,640
But that's the only way to
explain what I'm seeing.

281
00:21:17,820 --> 00:21:19,300
This man has done it.

282
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:22,440
My god, he did all of this.

283
00:21:23,040 --> 00:21:24,040
I himself.

284
00:21:24,540 --> 00:21:27,557
The only reason I am still
alive is because he wants me to

285
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:31,052
endure the torture of humiliation
before finishing me off.

286
00:21:31,560 --> 00:21:32,760
I just know it.

287
00:21:33,020 --> 00:21:37,255
He is going to do to me exactly what
I was planning to do to King Clays.

288
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:38,910
Huh?

289
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:53,270
It hurts.

290
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:23,520
Oh?

291
00:23:06,300 --> 00:23:07,700
Oh!

292
00:23:25,160 --> 00:23:26,277
Thank

293
00:23:26,360 --> 00:23:27,477
you

294
00:23:27,560 --> 00:23:34,560
so

295
00:23:40,540 --> 00:23:41,408
much for watching.
